The strongest negative cue is 'See also', especially as a heading. Reading
recommendations and link prompts have smaller negative values. Forum controls
such as 'Show Tags' and permanent-link labels have the opposite sign. A short
text tail provides context; document changes reset it. Other text predicts zero.
This captures one cue family, not most of the component's activation variation.
