Most positions contribute nothing. Bullet/bolt spellings, elastic/ballistic
stems, and selected East Asian bullet/arrow/arc characters get negative
values. The same
response also appears on separately tokenized '-let' endings, especially
after l or r. Bulletins are not bullets; capitalized Bolt is treated weakly.
The values approximate training averages. Positive responses and most
context-dependent variation are deliberately left unmodeled.
